    "directions": [
      "Submerge the legs in water, 1/4 cup of Big Tom’s Turkey Roasting Rub and Brine, and 1/4 cup of salt overnight.",
      "Remove the legs from the brine, rinse the legs off, pat them dry, and apply more of the Big Tom’s rub.",
